{
    "title": "6Minutes - Local News & Alerts",
    "description": "Check out the latest breaking US, world news and headlines by using our Free news app, we will give you the access to over 60 online newspapers and for free. Yes, you can read The Wall Street Journal, USA Today, The Washington Times, NBC News, ESPN and many more...\r\n\r\nMore than news, the app offer topics about : world news, weather, business, football, sport, showbiz, science and health stories.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\nLocal News Highlights\r\n\u2022 Get local news, traffic, events near by, local weather alerts & more in a curated daily briefing\r\n\u2022 Live stream news on local channels: follow local news, events, newspapers, & activities\r\n\u2022 Discover popular stories from hundreds of trusted sources.\r\n\r\nAvailable Topics in the app are: \r\n\u2022  News from the world of finance and business. Top stories, news bulletin, Features and analysis.\r\n\u2022  Geeky news everyday! Most inspiring ideas and entrepreneurship stories.\r\n\u2022  Hand-picked high quality contents from nutritious and healthy recipes\r\n\u2022 Get the latest celebrity, fashion, and music news.\r\n\u2022 Explore health and fitness trends.\r\n\u2022 Stay up-to-date with fashion, decor, and lifestyle trends.\r\n\r\nSecured :\r\nOur app is 100% Safe, so you don't need to worry about your information or some files that will harm your phone. We take care of your privacy.\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear your feedback. If you have recommendations or improvement suggestions, please write to us at: news.6minutes@gmail.com\r\n\r\nWe declare that all news comes from the RSS feed of news sites, if you are a news publisher and think our news does not meet your content terms, please contact us at: news.6minutes@gmail.com, we will remove the relevant news as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nUpon clicking the button above, you agree to the Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy and give your consent to install this product from the Google Play\u2122 Store. All third-party names (including company and service names), celebrity names, and images used here are trademarks, registered trademarks, or properties of their owners.\r\n\r\n Use of them here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by their respective holders.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nTerms and Conditions: \r\nhttps://www.6minutes.io/terms.html\r\nhttps://www.6minutes.io/privacy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Check out the latest breaking US, world news and headlines by using our Free news app, we will give you the access to over 60 online newspapers and for free. Yes, you can read The Wall Street Journal, USA Today, The Washington Times, NBC News, ESPN and many more...<br><br>More than news, the app offer topics about : world news, weather, business, football, sport, showbiz, science and health stories.<br><br>Key features<br><br>Local News Highlights<br>\u2022 Get local news, traffic, events near by, local weather alerts &amp; more in a curated daily briefing<br>\u2022 Live stream news on local channels: follow local news, events, newspapers, &amp; activities<br>\u2022 Discover popular stories from hundreds of trusted sources.<br><br>Available Topics in the app are: <br>\u2022  News from the world of finance and business. Top stories, news bulletin, Features and analysis.<br>\u2022  Geeky news everyday! Most inspiring ideas and entrepreneurship stories.<br>\u2022  Hand-picked high quality contents from nutritious and healthy recipes<br>\u2022 Get the latest celebrity, fashion, and music news.<br>\u2022 Explore health and fitness trends.<br>\u2022 Stay up-to-date with fashion, decor, and lifestyle trends.<br><br>Secured :<br>Our app is 100% Safe, so you don&#39;t need to worry about your information or some files that will harm your phone. We take care of your privacy.<br><br>We would love to hear your feedback. If you have recommendations or improvement suggestions, please write to us at: news.6minutes@gmail.com<br><br>We declare that all news comes from the RSS feed of news sites, if you are a news publisher and think our news does not meet your content terms, please contact us at: news.6minutes@gmail.com, we will remove the relevant news as soon as possible.<br><br>Upon clicking the button above, you agree to the Terms and Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy and give your consent to install this product from the Google Play\u2122 Store. All third-